drivers/i2c/busses/i2c-qcom-cci.c:261:49-50: Unneeded semicolon


 Remove unneeded semicolon.

Generated by: scripts/coccinelle/misc/semicolon.cocci

Fixes: 7c495c97e573 ("i2c: Add Qualcomm CCI I2C driver")
